#
# ALWAYS PASTE THE PROFILE LINK, not just the name. The usr_ id is the only
# thing that survives a rename: the bot re-checks every id every 6 hours, so a
# griefer who renames gets put back on the list by themselves. A line with only
# a name is a line they can escape by changing it.

